C4 op range. Against include/ of 8ad6212; apply with patch -p1 in the directory that holds include/.
run() takes the span of ops [from, stop), checked at the top of every call (from <= stop <= ops.size(), else std::logic_error),
and reads each op through the span without .at().
OPEN QUESTION for the owner: a jump target op.c of a Compiled that the compiler did not make is not checked per op any more.
PROVISIONAL: the name ops_between.
